row.menu_game = Menu
desc.menu_game = Which game's menu Re:Fine opens when both games are set up. Project DIVA F 2nd can be chosen once its port (ReFine-F2nd.exe) is installed. Applies after a restart.
row.f2nd_folder = Project DIVA F 2nd folder
desc.f2nd_folder = The folder of your Project DIVA F 2nd disc (the one with PS3_GAME). Re:Fine only reads its PARAM.SFO to tell which game it is.
row.choose_f2nd = Choose F 2nd folder
desc.choose_f2nd = Opens a folder picker for your Project DIVA F 2nd disc folder. It is kept in refine.ini (f2nd_folder).
games.not_set = not set
games.no_sfo = no PARAM.SFO there
games.not_f2nd = is not Project DIVA F 2nd
games.found = found, port pending
games.ready = ready
games.folder = Now:
row.show_launcher = Show launcher at start
desc.show_launcher = Shows the start screen (Play, Settings, Quit) before the game opens. Off starts the game straight away.
row.aniso = Anisotropic filtering
desc.aniso = Keeps textures sharp when they are seen at a slant (floors, the stage). Off is the original. Costs almost nothing on a modern graphics card.
row.sharpen = Sharpening
desc.sharpen = A contrast-adaptive sharpen when the picture is shown, so 720p textures look less soft at 1440p or 4K. Off is the original.
